		(property "Note" "NOT PLACED BY JLCPCB - hand soldered, bottom side. DB12 is marked \"do not install\" in the HL2 BOM, so the male header on the radio almost certainly has to be soldered too."
			(at 144.78 41.91 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
		(property "Description" "Mates HL2 DB12. HAND SOLDERED - LCSC has no vertical 2x3 female socket (their vertical female headers start at 2x4, and the 2x3 they do list, C99515, is side entry). Buy a 2x4 and cut it down, or source a 2x3 outside LCSC. NOTE pin 5 = FPGA PIN_89 (the ROLE strap read) and pin 6 = FPGA PIN_88 (the IN clock); rev A had these two swapped"
			(at 144.78 41.91 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
