		(property "Note" "EN = ROLE_N. Enabled in ROLE B, tri-stated in ROLE A. ROLE_N comes from U11 and carries a 10k pull-UP, so a missing or dead inverter leaves this driver enabled but its G2 translator port toward the HL2 DISABLED - the auxiliary link fails to work and nothing is stressed. Channels 3 and 4 unused."
			(at 1070.61 53.34 0)
			(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (hide yes)))
		(property "Description" "Quad LVDS driver, 400 Mbps, SOIC-16. AUX group G2 (data 1 pair + data 2 pair). Two channels used, two spare. EN = ROLE_N, so this pair is driven only in ROLE B"
