		(property "Note" "HAND SOLDERED, not placed by JLCPCB: 40 through-hole pins, and as a distinct part number it would cost a $3.07 per-unique-Extended-part fee plus $1.31 of joint fees. You are already soldering the mating male header into the dock. Bottom side. J14 pin 36 (ball U17) is deliberately open: it is the one spare pin, and the gateware should leave it unconstrained. COST.md 5."
